name: {{LOOP_NAME}}
description: >
  Drive an agent until output.json conforms to schema.json. Demonstrates the
  JsonSchemaGate end to end: real gate FAIL on a broken starting config
  (wrong types, missing field), then real gate PASS after the agent corrects
  it. Ships a deliberate schema violation so there is something concrete to fix
  on lap 1. Keyless — no API key required.
pattern: evaluator-optimizer
role:
  - engineering
  - backend
rung: L1
spec: PROMPT.md
runner:
  default: stub
gate:
  kind: jsonschema
bounds: bounds.yaml
memory: STATE.md
